msgid "Error mitigation and error suppression techniques are used to improve result quality when scaling up to larger workloads. This page provides high-level explanations for several of the error suppression and error mitigation techniques available with the Qiskit SDK and the IBM Quantum Compute service.\n"
msgstr "Ginagamit ang mga teknik ng error mitigation at error suppression para mapabuti ang kalidad ng resulta kapag nagpa-scale up sa mas malalaking workload. Nagbibigay ang pahinang ito ng mga high-level na paliwanag para sa ilang teknik ng error suppression at error mitigation na available sa Qiskit SDK at sa IBM Quantum Compute service.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"New execution model, now in beta release\">\n"
"The beta release of a new execution model is now available. The directed execution model provides more flexibility when customizing your error mitigation workflow. See the [Directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model) guide for more information.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Bagong execution model, nasa beta release na\">\n"
"Available na ang beta release ng bagong execution model. Ang directed execution model ay nagbibigay ng mas maraming flexibility kapag kina-customize ang iyong error mitigation workflow. Tingnan ang gabay na [Directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model) para sa karagdagang impormasyon.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
